# Support ticket triage
Where an incoming ticket goes in its first five minutes.

diagram triage dir=LR title="Ticket triage"
triage: inbox "New ticket" user
triage: sev "Is it a production outage?" decision
triage: page "Page on-call" svc "PagerDuty" focus
triage: dup "Duplicate of an open ticket?" decision
triage: merge "Merge and reply" svc
triage: queue "Assign to queue" svc "Round robin"
triage: inbox -> sev
triage: sev -> page : yes
triage: sev -> dup : no
triage: dup -> merge : yes
triage: dup -> queue : no

Both questions are answered by the first responder, not by automation.
